# Nov 14 2026: the blanket "/*  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow" rule was removed from this file.
# Workers static assets apply _headers to every path on every host, and the worker passes the ASSETS
# response headers through, so that rule overrode the worker's own exemption and made catfishcove.co
# invisible to search engines. The worker still sends noindex on every host except catfishcove.co.
/
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/*.html
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/menu.json
  Cache-Control: no-cache
